  "question": {
    "text": "If the data <math><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msub></math> is such that the mean of first four of these is <math><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo></math> the mean of the remaining six is <math><mn>16</mn></math> and the sum of squares of all of these is <math><mn>2000</mn></math>, then the standard deviation of this data is:"
  },
